(getContextMenuTargets()) }}</span>\n                <span class="layer-context-menu__shortcut">{{ shortcutModifier }}+G</span>\n            </a>\n        </li>\n        <li class="layer-context-menu__item-divider" ng-if="layerGroupsEnabled"></li>\n        <li class="layer-context-menu__item" role="menuitem">\n            <a href ng-click="bringLayersForwardAndClose()" class="layer-context-menu__link" ng-class="{\'layer-context-menu__link--disabled\': hasLockedContextMenuTargets()}">\n                <span>Bring forward</span>\n                <span class="layer-context-menu__shortcut">{{ shortcutModifier }}+]</span>\n            </a>\n        </li>\n        <li class="layer-context-menu__item" role="menuitem">\n            <a href ng-click="bringLayersBackwardAndClose()" class="layer-context-menu__link" ng-class="{\'layer-context-menu__link--disabled\': hasLockedContextMenuTargets()}">\n                <span>Bring backward</span>\n                <span class="layer-context-menu__shortcut">{{ shortcutModifier }}+[</span>\n            </a>\n        </li>\n        <li class="layer-context-menu__item" role="menuitem">\n            <a href ng-click="sendLayersToFrontAndClose()" class="layer-context-menu__link" ng-class="{\'layer-context-menu__link--disabled\': hasLockedContextMenuTargets()}">\n                <span>Send to front</span>\n                <span class="layer-context-menu__shortcut">]</span>\n            </a>\n        </li>\n        <li class="layer-context-menu__item" role="menuitem">\n            <a href ng-click="sendLayersToBackAndClose()" class="layer-context-menu__link" ng-class="{\'layer-context-menu__link--disabled\': hasLockedContextMenuTargets()}">\n                <span>Send to back</span>\n                <span class="layer-context-menu__shortcut">[</span>\n            </a>\n        </li>\n        <li class="layer-context-menu__item-divider"></li>\n        <li class="layer-context-menu__item" role="menuitem">\n            <a href ng-click="toggle